[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300300_04_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300300_04_0009","text":"拍摄工作人员"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300300_04_0010","text":"──那么，请将刚才折好的\n这架纸飞机，向着天空放飞"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300300_04_0020","text":"我想截取清爽青春的一页，所以请多关照——……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300300_04_0030","text":"好的／好……！／好——／好～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300300_04_0040","text":"拍摄已经准备好了，\n请noctchill的各位按自己的节奏来就好——！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300300_04_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300300_04_0050","text":"青、青春的一页，该摆什么表情才好呢……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300300_04_0060","text":"表现得开心不就好了\n……虽然我不知道"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300300_04_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300300_04_0070","text":"啊哈～\n那雏菜就和平常一样～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300300_04_0080","text":"截取吧，青春"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300300_04_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300300_04_0090","text":"……嗯！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300300_04_0100","text":"……那，放飞？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300300_04_0101","text":"Motion"}]
